asset:        354-footage-pngseq-timeremap.aep
title:        After Effects project fixture: base project with a layer from an imported PNG image sequence with time remapping enabled
author:       vangel76 (contributor)
source:       original work
license:      MIT OR Apache-2.0
added:        2026-10-13 by vangel76
notes:        Generated by the contributor with Adobe After Effects 2026 from scratch (one scripted change per file) as their own test data for the effectcraft-aep tests; contains only synthetic project structure, no third-party footage, presets, templates or personal data. No Adobe sample project or asset was used. The project container is byte-identical to the generated file; the XMP packet after it was replaced by the (smaller) packet of the base project to keep the fixtures small. The file path and machine name in the footage alias JSON were replaced by neutral text of the same length.
